            </div>
            <div class="post-content">刚完成一次马拉松训练，感觉超棒！💪</div>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="post image" class="post-image">
            <div class="post-actions">
                <span onclick="toggleLike(this)">👍 赞 52</span>
                <a href="post.html" style="color:#666;text-decoration:none;">💬 评论 12</a>
                <span>🔁 分享</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="post-card">
            <div class="post-header">
                <div class="avatar"></div>
                <div class="username">阿伟</div>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">周末去爬山，风景真的好美呀~ 🌲🌄</div>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="post image" class="post-image">
            <div class="post-actions">
                <span onclick="toggleLike(this)">👍 赞 34</span>
